# React js Node Js Productions — VPS Deployment Guide

**Stack:** React + Vite + Express (Node.js) + PostgreSQL
**Hosting:** Hostinger VPS (KVM 2)
**Domain:** hiddendirectors.com

---

## Step 1: VPS Setup aur Connect Karo

hPanel me VPS → KVM 2 buy karo (agar pehle se nahi liya), Ubuntu 24.04 LTS OS choose karo. Root password set karo, IP note karo.

```bash
ssh root@your_vps_ip
apt update && apt upgrade -y
```

---

## Step 2: Firewall Configure Karo

```bash
ufw allow OpenSSH
ufw allow 80
ufw allow 443
ufw enable
```

hPanel ke firewall section me bhi same 3 ports (22, 80, 443) allow karo.

---

## Step 3: Node, PM2, Nginx, PostgreSQL Install Karo

```bash
# Node.js
curl -fsSL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_20.x | bash -
apt install nodejs -y

# PM2 (process manager)
npm install -g pm2

# Nginx
apt install nginx -y

# PostgreSQL
apt install postgresql postgresql-contrib -y

# Git
apt install git -y
```

---

## Step 4: VPS pe PostgreSQL Database Banao

```bash
sudo -u postgres psql
```

Fir psql shell ke andar:

```sql
CREATE DATABASE hdp;
CREATE USER postgres_user WITH ENCRYPTED PASSWORD 'apna_password';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE hdp TO postgres_user;
\q
```

(Ya default `postgres` user ka password set karna ho to: `ALTER USER postgres PASSWORD 'apna_password';`)

---

## Step 5: Code VPS pe Deploy Karo

GitHub se clone karo (recommended — future updates easy ho jayengi):

```bash
cd /var/www
git clone your-repo-url hidden-directors
cd hidden-directors
```

Ya `scp`/WinSCP se zip upload karke `unzip` bhi kar sakte ho.

---

## Step 6: .env File Production Values ke Saath Banao

```bash
cp .env.example .env
nano .env
```

Ye values zaroor set karo:
- `DATABASE_URL` — VPS ke local PostgreSQL ki details ke saath
- `JWT_SECRET` — strong random string, purana default hata do
- `ADMIN_EMAIL` / `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — production credentials
- SMTP details — email notifications ke liye
- `WHATSAPP_NUMBER`
- `APP_URL=https://hiddendirectors.com`

---

## Step 7: Dependencies Install aur Production Build Banao

```bash
npm install
npm run build
```

`npm install` `pg` package bhi install kar dega. `npm run build` Vite se frontend build karega aur `server.ts` ko `dist/server.cjs` me bundle karega. Build successful hone ke baad `dist` folder check karo ki `server.cjs` bana hai.

---

## Step 8: PM2 se App Start Karo aur DB Connection Verify Karo

```bash
NODE_ENV=production pm2 start dist/server.cjs --name hidden-directors
pm2 logs hidden-directors
```

Logs me ye line dikhni chahiye:
```
[Database] PostgreSQL connected and schema ready.
```

Fir auto-start setup karo (VPS reboot hone par bhi app chalta rahe):

```bash
pm2 startup
pm2 save
```

(`pm2 startup` jo command dikhaye wo copy-paste karke run karo.)

---

## Baaki Bache Steps (Next)

- Nginx reverse proxy config karo (port 3000 → domain)
- Domain DNS point karo (A record → VPS IP)
- Certbot se free SSL lagao
- Live site test karo end-to-end



